<BaseLayout title="About André Nicolas — Full Stack Engineer" description="About André Nicolas: a Full Stack Engineer with a frontend specialty, product judgment, and experience across APIs, data, platform, and AI-enabled work.">
  <main class="wrapper about"><section class="intro"><p class="eyebrow">About</p><h1 class="display">Software is only useful when people can make sense of it.</h1></section><section class="story"><img src="/assets/portrait.jpg" alt="Portrait of André Nicolas" /><div><p>I’m a Full Stack Engineer and Software Engineer with a frontend specialty. I work where product context, systems thinking, and interaction design meet—so complex software is both technically sound and understandable to the people using it.</p><p>At MSPA, my current employment title is Frontend Engineer. I contribute across privacy and compliance products used by more than ten companies, from requirements and user flows through Angular and TypeScript implementation, APIs, data, delivery, and production support when the work crosses layers.</p><p>My project work extends that range: authorization and state safeguards in FechaRacha, checkout and webhook orchestration in Terto Beats, offline-first mobile architecture for Saúde em Campo, and an academic Java/Android application. I also use AI as an engineering practice and have integrated user-facing generative-AI capabilities with structured, sanitized interactions.</p></div></section><section class="principles"><p class="eyebrow">What I care about</p><div><h2 class="display">Clarity is an engineering outcome.</h2><p>Useful software respects attention. It explains complex work, gives people confidence, and leaves room for the task at hand—whether the work is a component, an API boundary, a data model, or a complete product flow.</p></div></section><section class="details"><div><p class="eyebrow">Based in</p><p>Maceió, Brazil</p></div><div><p class="eyebrow">Elsewhere</p><p><a href="https://github.com/devAndreNicolas" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a><br /><a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/devandrenicolas" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">LinkedIn ↗</a><br /><a href="/cv/">Role-specific CVs →</a></p></div><div><p class="eyebrow">Contact</p><p><a href="mailto:devandrenicolas@gmail.com">devandrenicolas@gmail.com</a></p></div></section></main>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.about { padding:5rem 0 8rem; }.intro { max-width:62rem; }.intro h1 { margin-top:1rem; font-size:clamp(3.2rem, 7vw, 6.8rem); }.story { display:grid; grid-template-columns:.72fr 1fr; gap:clamp(2rem, 7vw, 7rem); margin-top:6rem; }.story img { width:100%; aspect-ratio:4/5; object-fit:cover; filter:grayscale(100%); }.story div { display:flex; flex-direction:column; gap:1.5rem; max-width:39rem; color:var(--muted); font-size:1.12rem; }.principles { display:grid; grid-template-columns:.72fr 1fr; gap:clamp(2rem, 7vw, 7rem); margin-top:7rem; padding-top:1rem; border-top:1px solid var(--line); }.principles h2 { font-size:clamp(2.4rem, 4.4vw, 4.5rem); }.principles p:last-child { margin-top:1rem; color:var(--muted); }.details { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:2rem; margin-top:6rem; padding-top:1rem; border-top:1px solid var(--line); }.details p + p { margin-top:.4rem; }.details a { color:var(--blue); } @media(max-width:42rem) { .story,.principles,.details { grid-template-columns:1fr; }.story { margin-top:4rem; }.principles { margin-top:4rem; }.details { margin-top:4rem; gap:1.5rem; } }</style>
